gos tóxicos<\/h3><p>El enfoque no es manipular, sino recuperar tu centro.<\/p><\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/section>\n\n  <section class=\"lp-section white\" id=\"comprar\">\n    <div class=\"lp-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"lp-offer\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"lp-kicker\">Oferta de lanzamiento<\/div>\n          <h2>Llevate el ebook + los 3 bonos gratis por AR$19.900<\/h2>\n          <p>Valor total: AR$84.699. Hoy accedés con 50% OFF y los bonos incluidos sin costo adicional.<\/p>\n          <a class=\"lp-btn\" href=\"\/cart\/TU_VARIANT_ID:1?checkout\">Comprar ahora →<\/a>\n        <\/div>\n\n        <div class=\"lp-stack\">\n          <div class=\"lp-stack-row\"><span>Ebook principal<\/span><strong>AR$39.999<\/strong><\/div>\n          <div class=\"lp-stack-row\"><span>Bono 1<\/span><strong>AR$15.000<\/strong><\/div>\n          <div class=\"lp-stack-row\"><span>Bono 2<\/span><strong>AR$13.800<\/strong><\/div>\n          <div class=\"lp-stack-row\"><span>Bono 3<\/span><strong>AR$15.900<\/strong><\/div>\n          <div class=\"lp-stack-row total\"><span>Hoy pagás<\/span><strong>AR$19.900<\/strong><\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/section>\n\n  <section class=\"lp-section\">\n    <div class=\"lp-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"lp-head\">\n        <div class=\"lp-kicker\">Preguntas frecuentes<\/div>\n        <h2>Antes de comprar<\/h2>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"lp-faq\">\n        <details open><summary>¿Este ebook garantiza que mi ex va a volver?<\/summary><p>No. Nadie puede garantizar eso. El ebook te ayuda a recuperar estabilidad y actuar con más claridad.<\/p><\/details>\n        <details><summary>¿Sirve si recién terminé la relación?<\/summary><p>Sí. Es útil cuando estás en el momento más impulsivo.<\/p><\/details>\n        <details><summary>¿Qué incluye la oferta?<\/summary><p>Incluye el ebook principal y tres bonos gratis.<\/p><\/details>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/section>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      const countdownEls = document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-countdown]\");\n      const stockEls = document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-stock]\");\n      const end = Date.now() + 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;\n\n      function updateTimer() {\n        const remaining = end - Date.now();\n        const total = Math.max(0, Math.floor(remaining \/ 1000));\n        const h = String(Math.floor(total \/ 3600)).padStart(2, \"0\");\n        const m = String(Math.floor((total % 3600) \/ 60)).padStart(2, \"0\");\n        const s = String(total % 60).padStart(2, \"0\");\n        countdownEls.forEach(el => el.textContent = `${h}:${m}:${s}`);\n      }\n\n      setInterval(updateTimer, 1000);\n      updateTimer();\n\n      let stock = 37;\n      setInterval(function () {\n        if (stock > 5 && Math.random() > .55) {\n          stock--;\n          stockEls.forEach(el => el.textContent = stock);\n        }\n      }, 90000);\n    })();\n  <\/script>\n<\/section>","color_scheme":"","section_width":"page-width","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}}},"order":["main","custom_liquid_wtbzHG"]}